kalliopen-launcher (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * Basic start, stop and update management of the Docker container.
  * Run database migrations through the dedicated kalliopen-migrator
    container before starting the application.
  * Keep the launcher available in the system tray when its window is closed.
  * Automatic periodic backups with retention policy.
  * Persists app data through Docker volumes.

